<item><title>Sao Tome&apos;s finance minister leaves tax recovery against SOLIVAN unresolved</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/st/sao-tome-s-finance-minister-leaves-tax-recovery-against-f93e4d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/st/sao-tome-s-finance-minister-leaves-tax-recovery-against-f93e4d/</guid><category>Sao Tome and Principe</category><description>Gareth Guadalupe ordered the seizure of SOLIVAN&apos;s assets in March 2026 as the state sought to recover money owed over the Rosema brewery&apos;s tax arrears.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 16:03:12 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/st.jpg" length="38731" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/st.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
